.TH status 1  "status " 
.SH NAME
status \- Show live daemon status (peers, clipboard)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBqdrop status\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-waybar\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show live daemon status (peers, clipboard)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit the raw JSON from the daemon
.TP
\fB\-\-waybar\fR
Emit a single line of waybar JSON (`text` / `tooltip` / `class`)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
